WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.505
Intel One Mono

00:00:01.317 --> 00:00:01.965
font

00:00:02.502 --> 00:00:03.987
Introducing Intel One

00:00:03.799 --> 00:00:04.388
Mono

00:00:04.613 --> 00:00:06.157
an expressive monospaced

00:00:05.969 --> 00:00:07.277
font family that’s

00:00:07.089 --> 00:00:08.292
built with clarity

00:00:08.516 --> 00:00:09.424
legibility

00:00:09.495 --> 00:00:10.285
and the needs

00:00:10.096 --> 00:00:11.027
of developers in

00:00:10.839 --> 00:00:11.476
mind

00:00:11.998 --> 00:00:13.259
Intel One Mono

00:00:13.118 --> 00:00:14.120
also covers a

00:00:13.932 --> 00:00:14.863
wide range of

00:00:14.710 --> 00:00:16.408
over 200 languages

00:00:16.326 --> 00:00:17.163
using the Latin

00:00:16.974 --> 00:00:17.658
script

00:00:17.797 --> 00:00:19.058
We recommend using

00:00:18.870 --> 00:00:19.825
these fonts at

00:00:19.637 --> 00:00:20.933
7 points and

00:00:20.745 --> 00:00:21.830
larger in print

00:00:22.066 --> 00:00:23.327
9 pixels and

00:00:23.151 --> 00:00:24.389
larger on screen

00:00:24.926 --> 00:00:26.223
Additional refinements

00:00:26.035 --> 00:00:27.213
are available via

00:00:27.060 --> 00:00:29.678
ss02 and ss03

00:00:29.926 --> 00:00:31.246
Stylistic Set 2

00:00:31.058 --> 00:00:32.532
switches the combinations

00:00:32.343 --> 00:00:33.452
to arrow forms

00:00:33.511 --> 00:00:34.843
and Stylistic Set

00:00:34.655 --> 00:00:36.293
3 additionally activates

00:00:36.235 --> 00:00:38.310
a www ligature

00:00:38.838 --> 00:00:39.852
Full story on

00:00:39.663 --> 00:00:40.559
the dashboard
